sequenceDiagram
    actor Researcher
    participant Screen as Capture screen
    participant Pipeline as Wildlife pipeline
    participant Native as Native image tensor
    participant ORT as ONNX Runtime
    participant Pack as Local embedding database
    participant Match as Match service
    participant DB as SQLite and device files
    participant Review as Match review

    Researcher->>Screen: Capture or select a photo
    Screen->>Screen: Read optional GPS and processing context
    Screen->>Pipeline: Process local image URI
    Pipeline->>Native: Decode, resize, and normalize image
    Native->>ORT: Run detector
    ORT-->>Pipeline: Bounding boxes and confidence
    Pipeline->>Native: Crop and normalize each detection
    Native->>ORT: Run MiewID embedding model
    ORT-->>Pipeline: Embedding vector (current model: 2,152 floats)
    Pipeline->>Pack: Load version-compatible packs and species-matched local vectors
    Pipeline->>Match: Rank candidates by cosine similarity
    Match-->>Screen: Candidates, scores, and sources
    Screen->>DB: Save observation with processing-time timestamp
    Screen->>Review: Open candidate review
    alt Approve a candidate
        Researcher->>Review: Approve pack or local candidate
        Review->>DB: Persist approved decision
    else Create provisional local individual
        Researcher->>Review: Select no match
        Review->>DB: Persist local record and approved local decision
    else Skip
        Researcher->>Review: Skip review
        Review-->>Researcher: Leave detection pending
    end